ext-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">Texas Tax Guide 2026: No Income Tax, But What About Property and Sales Tax?</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Texas has no state income tax, but property tax is among the highest. Complete guide to Texas taxes in 2026.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">texas tax calculator</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">income tax in texas</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">taxable income</span></div></a><a class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/50 bg-card p-5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/blog/new-york-tax-guide-2026\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium bg-violet-100 text-violet-800 dark:bg-violet-500/20 dark:text-violet-400 border-violet-300 dark:border-violet-500/30\">State Tax</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">June 19, 2026</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-emerald-600 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors line-clamp-2 mb-1.5\">New York State Taxes 2026: NYC Tax, Filing, and What You Owe</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Complete guide to New York taxes in 2026. NYC tax rates, state income tax brackets, estate tax, and filing.</p><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\">new york tax calculator</span><span class=\"inl